# Backup files
backups/
# Root-anchored: these are the local scratch migration folders, NOT
# api/migrations/. Unanchored, 'mig*/' also swallowed api/migrations/, so every
# migration added since 020 was silently ignored by git and never committed -
# while DEPLOYMENT.md tells operators to run them by path.
/mig*/
build/
build*/